\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Come, follow Me!  Calls Christ, our Lord;
\par \pard\li180\sl180\slmult0 ye Christians, come and follow,
\par Deny yourselves, for-sake the world;
\par heed now My call and follow!
\par Take up your cross and trials sore
\par and follow as I go before.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I am the light! It shines for you,
\par \pard\li180\sl180\slmult0 My sacred life was given;
\par He who draws nigh and follows Me,
\par for heav'nly gain has striven.
\par \cf1 I am the way, I know full well,\cf0 
\par how one must walk in peace to dwell.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. My heart is fill'd with humbleness,
\par \pard\li180\sl180\slmult0\qj and loving is My nature.
\par My mouth with goodness overflows,
\par truth beams from ev'ry feature.
\par My soul and spirit, strength and mind,
\par look up and are to God resigned.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. I show you that which harmful is,
\par \pard\li180\sl180\slmult0 to be avoided ever;
\par your heart from sin and evil lust,
\par to cleanse and to deliver;
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 I am the Saviour of your soul,
\par and lead you to the heav'nly goal.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. When you are weak, I lead you on,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj Close by your side I'm standing;
\par I battle, too, I clear the way,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj in conflict all commanding.
\par The soldier's shame who fears the foes,
\par When bravely on the leader goes.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.  Whoever loves so well his life,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 That trespasses shall be slained.
\par And he that loses his own life,
\par For my sake shall be regained.
\par Whosoever takes not the Cross,
\par  To follow me shall not remain.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  7. So let us then with heart and soul,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 proceed, our God obeying;
\par and with new courage and good cheer,
\par to Him for all things praying.
\par For he who fights not shall not wear,
\par \pard    The crown of life eternal there.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

